X:1
T:Funeral March
C:Frédéric Chopin
O:Piano Sonata No. 2 in B-flat minor, Op. 35, third movement
N:The opening march and its rising answer (20 bars); the rest of the movement
N:is left out. Transposed down a minor seventh from B-flat minor to C minor, so
N:the lowest note is C4 and the highest G5. Melody from the flutetunes.com MIDI.
N:The grace notes on the second beat of bars 5 and 13 are omitted.
N:Chords simplified from the bass and inner parts of that arrangement.
M:4/4
Q:1/4=60
L:1/8
